codex
Two P1 issues already carried in the rc notes remain: a permission error can be mistaken for an absent private-terms file, and tracked links materialized as regular files by `core.symlinks=false` are rejected. The facade’s executable globals resolve correctly; the remaining refactor issues concern imports and annotations.
